        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, desktop, mix, office use</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, desktop, mix, office use
The ratio 36/64 is based on a survey carried out in Japan. The computer office use is calculated according to the share between active, standby and off modes taken from literature and producer information.;
Synonyms: PC; 
UUID: 75630438-8271-3c37-b19f-f29411c60045
Describes a mixed use of a desktop computer with the ratio 36% CRT monitor and 64% LCD monitor. Calculated per 1 hour of computer use in an office. UCTE production mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the desktop computer, which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, survey and assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: see Geography and Technology
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_75630438-8271-3c37-b19f-f29411c60045.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
